    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "kizuna_language_c_02",
      "hash64": "19F3434A1E12C209",
      "text": "Danke noch mal für deine Hilfe neulich!\\nHier, willst du selbst nach Pamo sehen?[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "kizuna_language_c_poke_01",
      "hash64": "B233CFEF13F66A4C",
      "text": "...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "kizuna_language_c_select_01",
      "hash64": "7421E4753FE5FE0F",
      "text": "Geht es ihm besser?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_language_c_select_02",
      "hash64": "7421E5753FE5FFC2",
      "text": "Es wirkt... ruhig?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_language_c_03",
      "hash64": "19F3424A1E12C056",
      "text": "Hm... Ja, ihm geht es wieder alright, aber es ist\\nwohl eher von der gemütlichen Sorte.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_language_c_ecology_01",
      "hash64": "3D325D92640E9D41",
      "text": "Ich habe auch Señora Mimi gebeten, es zu\\nuntersuchen. Sie meinte, Pamo sei völlig gesund.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_language_c_ecology_02",
      "hash64": "3D325A92640E9828",
      "text": "Es hat anscheinend keinerlei Verletzungen oder\\nKrankheiten.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_language_c_poke_02",
      "hash64": "B233D2EF13F66F65",
      "text": "...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_language_c_04",
      "hash64": "19F3454A1E12C56F",
      "text": "Aber... Es gibt keinen Mucks von sich.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_language_c_05",
      "hash64": "19F3444A1E12C3BC",
      "text": "Selbst Señor Jim kann sich das nicht erklären.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "kizuna_language_c_ecology_03",
      "hash64": "3D325B92640E99DB",
      "text": "Sorry, dass ich keine große Hilfe sein konnte.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "kizuna_language_c_06",
      "hash64": "19F3474A1E12C8D5",
      "text": "Ah, das macht doch nichts! No worries![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "kizuna_language_c_07",
      "hash64": "19F3464A1E12C722",
      "text": "Allerdings habe ich mal einen Blick auf die\\nAufzeichnungen der Überwachungskameras\\r\\nder Akademie geworfen.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 108,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "kizuna_language_c_08",
      "hash64": "19F3494A1E12CC3B",
      "text": "Offenbar wurde es von einem wilden Pokémon\\nangegriffen und ist deshalb in die Akademie\\r\\ngeflüchtet.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 101,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "kizuna_language_c_09",
      "hash64": "19F3484A1E12CA88",
      "text": "Vielleicht war der Schock so groß, dass es im\\nMoment einfach nicht sprechen mag...[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "kizuna_language_c_poke_03",
      "hash64": "B233D1EF13F66DB2",
      "text": "...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "kizuna_language_c_10",
      "hash64": "19EFDB4A1E0FDB7A",
      "text": "Ja, das muss es sein! In dem Fall ist es natürlich\\nvöllig in Ordnung, dass es so schweigsam ist.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "kizuna_language_c_11",
      "hash64": "19EFDC4A1E0FDD2D",
      "text": "Attendons un peu, früher oder später wird es sich\\nbestimmt wieder äußern wollen.\\c\\nMit Geduld und Zeit kommt man weit![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 119,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "kizuna_language_c_12",
      "hash64": "19EFD94A1E0FD814",
      "text": "Was in den Herzen anderer vor sich geht, ist für\\nuns oft unbegreiflich... Egal, ob man one, deux,\\r\\ntre oder cuatro Sprachen beherrscht.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 137,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "kizuna_language_c_13",
      "hash64": "19EFDA4A1E0FD9C7",
      "text": "Aber ich werde nicht den Mut verlieren und mich\\ngedulden, bis wir zwei uns verstehen.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "kizuna_language_c_system_01",
      "hash64": "90C28A31D82D201C",
      "text": "Du hast Señor Salvatores Vertrauen gewonnen!",
      "flags": 0,
